BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spring Carnival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T160000
UID:3e589381036925d22e412402a0e9b15d@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:For 50 years\, Spring Hill School has been a quiet gem in the 
 heart of Petaluma. This spring\, we’re opening our doors wide and inviti
 ng our entire community to celebrate with us! Whether you’ve lived next 
 door for years or are just discovering us for the first time\, we would lo
 ve for you to join us for our Spring Community Carnival\, celebrating our 
 50 year anniversary\, on Saturday\, April 25\, from 12:00–4:00 PM. ?? Wh
 y Visit Us? Our TK-8 campus will be transformed into a vibrant festival of
  play and discovery. It’s the perfect way to experience the "Spring Hill
  Advantage" firsthand: - Experience Our Campus: See where learning comes a
 live\, from our hands-on STEM projects to our intentional\, small-class en
 vironments. - The Entertainment: Enjoy a professional Magician\, a Spectac
 ular Bubble Show\, and unlimited Bouncy Houses. - The Treats: Complimentar
 y popcorn and cotton candy for all guests! - The Main Event: Watch our Hea
 d of School take the plunge in the Dunk Tank! ?What Makes Spring Hill
LOCATION:Petaluma\, CA
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.us/events/details/spring-carnival
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
